# Both files are written by sops, not by hand. Prettier drift on them is
# permanent rather than a one-off: every `sops set` rewrites the envelope in
# sops' own formatting, so a lint gate on them fails again after each edit.
# config-production.json additionally must stay byte-identical to the copy live
# on the production host, which is what lets that host's working tree go clean
# on pull instead of needing a config rewrite during an auction.
